[% PageVersion = 'Documentation/system/REBUILD_AND_DEPLOY_INSTRUCTIONS.tt,v 2.0 2026/07/31 Shanta Exp ' %]

<h1 id="superseded">Document Superseded</h1>

<div class="container warning">
    <div class="container-header">This document is no longer current</div>
    <div class="container-content">
        <div class="container-content-inner">
            <p><strong>REBUILD_AND_DEPLOY_INSTRUCTIONS.tt is superseded.</strong> It described an outdated flow
            (building the production container locally on the prod host, using
            <code>docker-compose.server.yml</code>) that does not match the actual pipeline.</p>
            <p>The authoritative procedure is now:</p>
            <p style="font-size:1.1em;"><strong>&rarr;
                <a href="/Documentation/system/DEPLOY_WORKFLOW">Canonical Deploy Workflow (Production)</a>
            </strong></p>
            <p>That document states the only supported flow: <strong>build on workstation &rarr; push to Docker
            Hub &rarr; Pull &amp; Deploy onto production1</strong>, all driven from the workstation UI.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
